  "character_tex": "Integrable characters of affine $SU(2)_k$ at $z=1$, labelled by $l = 2j = 0,\\dots,k$: $\\chi_l(\\tau) = \\frac{q^{h_l - c/24}}{\\prod_{n\\ge1}(1-q^n)^3}\\sum_{m\\in\\mathbb{Z}} \\big(l+1+2(k+2)m\\big)\\, q^{(k+2)m^2 + (l+1)m}$, $h_l = \\frac{l(l+2)}{4(k+2)}$, $c = \\frac{3k}{k+2}$; computed from the graded Weyl-Kac formula and summed over the $J^3_0$ grading.",
  "description": "$D_{11}$ invariant of $SU(2)_{18}$ (Cappelli-Itzykson-Zuber), a permutation invariant (odd $l$ paired with $18-l$); equivalently the orbifold of the diagonal theory by the $\\mathbb{Z}_2$ centre, which keeps the untwisted states with even $l$ and adds the twisted-sector states $\\chi_l\\overline{\\chi_{18-l}}$ with $l$ odd. Blocks are $SU(2)_{18}$ characters and $Z$ gives their multiplicities.",
